# Supabase CLI state and secrets.
#
# `supabase link` writes the project ref here, and `supabase secrets set --env-file`
# reads a .env that holds real credentials. Neither belongs in the repo — the
# FatSecret client secret is the one credential in this project that is not
# safe to publish, unlike the publishable key in supabase_config.dart, which is
# designed to ship.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.env
supabase/functions/**/.env
.env
.env.local
